notes.body:
Sorry my previous messages were not clear enough. You can simplify all this code from lines 2215 to 2230 with (for example):
```
if (opt_offset & 0x07) {
    proto_tree_add_item(icmp6opt_tree, hf_icmpv6_opt_padding, tvb, opt_offset, 8 - (opt_offset & 0x07), ENC_NA);
    opt_offset += 8 - (opt_offset & 0x07);
}
```
it will print all the padding bytes, even if they are (wrongly) not set to 0.

